      "content": "i get that it's debated, but it feels like the \"proponents\" arguments were kind of just corporate talking points about competitiveness, whereas the critics actually had real evidence about job losses in the manufacturing belt. don't you think the consensus among labor advocates is that it was objectively bad for blue-collar workers?",
